        "original_id": "c9dcd40a-9d88-56fb-8ebd-a772b959d707",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Fulgencio Batista y Zaldívar, Antonio Prío, Carlos Prío Socarrás, Osvaldo Farrés, Ramón Grau\n- Roles: President of Cuba\n- Works: \"Quizás, Quizás, Quizás\"\n\nFacts:\n- Carlos Prío Socarrás was the brother of Antonio Prío and served as President of Cuba.\n- Fulgencio Batista y Zaldívar held the same political position as Carlos Prío Socarrás, serving as President of Cuba.\n- Osvaldo Farrés composed the song \"Quizás, Quizás, Quizás.\"\n- Ramón Grau inspired Osvaldo Farrés in connection with the song \"Quizás, Quizás, Quizás.\"\n- Fulgencio Batista y Zaldívar overthrew Ramón Grau.",
